rsyslog checked-write collector

Upstream: rsyslog, https://www.rsyslog.com/
Baseline: Ubuntu source package rsyslog 8.2312.0-3ubuntu9.4.
The corresponding original source and Ubuntu security-patch archive are pinned
by filename, length and SHA-256 in source.json. Retain the Ubuntu patches;
applying this local change to an unpatched upstream release is not equivalent.

Local modifications cover checked file output and stream/queue write-error
handling. The affected upstream files retain their own copyright and terms:

- tools/omfile.c: Copyright 2007-2023 Adiscon GmbH; Apache-2.0.
  The project-local changes to this file are also Apache-2.0.
- runtime/stream.c: Copyright 2008-2022 Rainer Gerhards and Adiscon GmbH;
  LGPL-3.0-or-later.
- runtime/stream.h: Copyright 2008-2018 Rainer Gerhards and Adiscon GmbH;
  LGPL-3.0-or-later.
- runtime/queue.c: Copyright 2008-2019 Rainer Gerhards and Adiscon GmbH;
  LGPL-3.0-or-later.

Project-local changes to these runtime files retain LGPL-3.0-or-later terms;
they are not covered by the FLS application's Apache-2.0 grant. The complete
collector also contains independently GPL-licensed components. COPYING,
COPYING.LESSER and COPYING.ASL20 reproduce the supplied upstream license texts.
Preserve upstream copyright, Ubuntu copyright and dependency notices when
building or distributing. This collector is not relicensed under the FLS
Apache-2.0 license.

The source checkout supplies the local patch, source provenance and build recipe.
Signed releases bundle a separately executed collector and attach its complete
corresponding source archive as a separate asset: original Ubuntu source,
Ubuntu patches, local modifications, license texts and build recipe. The build
and release tools verify these inputs against source.json and the source offer
inventory. Runtime acceptance is recorded separately for each release; these
notices do not claim that pending write-error tests have passed.
No local configuration, logs, queue files or private build-host metadata is
included in the public source offer.
